WEBVTT

00:10:58.829 --> 00:11:01.537
a senior role at your distribution
company and like have

00:11:01.537 --> 00:11:03.912
an internship program with
two interns, you're fine.

00:11:04.287 --> 00:11:08.162
And so the way I read the academy's
sort of announcement is

00:11:08.537 --> 00:11:14.037
a public statement that in order to be
a responsible corporate citizen of

00:11:14.037 --> 00:11:19.704
the film industry, you have to be trying
to expand the pipeline ever so slightly.

00:11:20.496 --> 00:11:21.829
And if you're not doing that,

00:11:21.829 --> 00:11:24.704
then we're not going to give you
the chance of winning an Oscar.

00:11:25.662 --> 00:11:31.871
But they did not prevent anyone who has
made a movie from getting, you know,